### Quick API tests (open in Visual Studio: it shows a "Send request" link above each request)
@host = https://localhost:7100

### All room types
GET {{host}}/api/roomtypes

### Rooms free for a stay
GET {{host}}/api/rooms/available?checkIn=2026-12-20&checkOut=2026-12-23&guests=2

### Reservation history of customer 1
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?customerId=1
